  "intentional_behavior_change_outside_characterization_corpus": [
    "Receipt and invoice PDFs use typed evidence, without bank movements or OFX exports; CSV and XLSX remain available. Shared parsing affects both Free and PRO.",
    "Previously supported single-row Ita?/Sicoob receipts now retain their labeled values as evidence rather than bank movements; regression tests assert this explicitly.",
    "Only active authenticated PRO users can manually change the type of their own PDF documents. Changes preserve prior extraction and append actor, timestamp and operation history.",
    "Existing documents are not automatically rewritten. Manually reclassifying a statement as evidence soft-deletes its bank rows and excludes them from totals; restoring the previous statement reading is supported.",
    "Manual correction does not reread the PDF. Evidence without a prior bank reading cannot be converted into a statement by this action.",
    "Fiscal authority verification, invoice item processing, automatic bank linking and full reprocessing remain deferred."
  ],
  "storage_and_rollout": {
    "schema_migration": false,
    "new_metadata": [
